# All of `.skill-map/` is a local scan/serve cache. Only settings.json (the
# committed active-lens pin, re-included below) is tracked; the DB, its WAL,
# backups, serve.json, settings.local.json, and the generated activity bridge
# (`sm activity install codex` regenerates it) stay out of the tree.
/.skill-map/*
!/.skill-map/settings.json
